{
  "_comment": [
    "The control panel, as data. scripts/deploy.py reads this file and creates the databases in whatever",
    "Notion workspace you point it at, so nothing here is tied to one account.",
    "Two passes: databases first (no relations), then the relations, because a relation needs the id of a",
    "database that does not exist yet on the first pass. Multi-select options must exist before any row is",
    "written, so the seed vocabulary is declared here rather than created on the fly."
  ],
  "databases": {
    "topics": {
